{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":24,"timestamp":"2026-06-15T18:10:35.526051252Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"e5ffa6be-9e18-4820-a140-d839055050ae","comment_uuid":"64e0f1d1-fb4c-487b-a21d-e8447b2cb21a","author":"y4rr","content":"Class: feature / verifier cleanup for the reopened #1682 residue. Probe at HEAD shows rand_on_device/randn_on_device CUDA floating dtypes now dispatch through backend RNG slots for f32/f64/f16/bf16 (no CPU-generation upload in creation.rs); f64 uses NVRTC curand Philox kernels and f16/bf16 use f32 CUDA Philox plus on-device cast kernels. Remaining defect is the stale ferrotorch-core surface ledger: four deferred exclusions still cite #1682 as if CUDA conformance coverage were absent. Plan: add a CUDA-gated conformance_creation_gpu.rs that directly exercises creation::rand_on_device/creation::randn_on_device and re-exports across f32/f64/f16/bf16 with device assertions, remove the four deferred #1682 exclusions, run live GPU RNG tests plus surface gate/fmt/clippy, then close #1682 as stale-resolved at HEAD. Scope note: exact torch.cuda byte-stream layout remains open separately as #1683.","created_at":"2026-06-15T18:10:35.523568487Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAsTOVvKp75o4m9J5pH4hwnOov1katD5TUHyHtIrJTbNG6f+mp+MO4YlQrLybUFbMXCRPBZkXNQmCukIrqQ7k+AQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCoD5c44PXCkH/QExJ/0s1APgLYh+5iJWpQZ3YrfF25adTDvzR5pKV0lVGYI3R7BUjXrZdJ17zHhj1EdTzQb+AI="}
{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":25,"timestamp":"2026-06-15T18:13:52.674623180Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"e5ffa6be-9e18-4820-a140-d839055050ae","comment_uuid":"cb691972-4a7d-4ab7-a5d6-5e1c4c806a10","author":"y4rr","content":"Result at HEAD: #1682 is implemented and now has core conformance coverage. Static evidence: ferrotorch-core/src/creation.rs dispatches Device::Cuda(_) floating dtypes through backend.rand_uniform_f32/f64/f16/bf16 and backend.randn_normal_f32/f64/f16/bf16 into TensorStorage::gpu(handle); non-f32 CUDA no longer CPU-generates then uploads. Backend evidence: ferrotorch-gpu/src/backend_impl.rs routes f32 to gpu_philox_uniform/normal, f64 to NVRTC curand Philox kernels, and f16/bf16 to f32 CUDA Philox plus on-device f32->half/bfloat conversion kernels. Test evidence: cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --test conformance_surface_coverage -- --nocapture => 3 passed; coverage 810/1606, excluded 796, uncovered 0. cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --features gpu --test conformance_creation_gpu -- --nocapture --test-threads=1 => 3 passed; exercises creation::rand_on_device/creation::randn_on_device and top-level re-exports with CUDA residency assertions across f32/f64/f16/bf16. cargo test -p ferrotorch-gpu --features cuda --test on_device_rng -- --nocapture --test-threads=1 => 13 passed, including non-f32 CUDA uniform/normal distribution checks. cargo test -p ferrotorch-gpu --features cuda --test divergence_on_device_philox_live_audit -- --nocapture --test-threads=1 => 5 passed, including boundary sizes and consecutive-call stream continuation. Hygiene: cargo fmt --all --check, git diff --check, and cargo clippy -p ferrotorch-core --features gpu --test conformance_creation_gpu --test conformance_surface_coverage -- -D warnings all passed. Scope boundary: exact torch.cuda byte-stream/subsequence layout remains separately open as #1683; this closes the on-device generation/residency/distribution/reproducibility contract for #1682.","created_at":"202