{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":30,"timestamp":"2026-06-15T18:19:51.344143999Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"6b4a0d11-7943-4a5a-b2d3-286f18fad2ba","comment_uuid":"00076106-ef5f-4cc9-86a3-d6df6c14d4c6","author":"y4rr","content":"Class: CLASS-U / stale-at-HEAD safety verification with added GPU coverage. Audit inspection shows the original unsafe path has already been hardened at HEAD: Tensor::try_stride_view and try_stride_view_operation call stride_tricks::validate_bounds before constructing metadata; the unchecked constructor is private; as_strided/as_strided_copy/as_strided_scatter also validate bounds. PyTorch probe on 2.11.0+cu130: nonempty OOB as_strided raises RuntimeError, empty views with arbitrary storage_offset are accepted. Plan for this pass: add missing CUDA probes proving invalid stride metadata is rejected before any strided-copy kernel can read OOB and empty arbitrary-offset CUDA views do not read storage; run targeted CPU/CUDA invariant tests, stride-tricks tests, clippy/fmt/full lib; close #1698 if evidence holds. Separate finding discovered during probe: PyTorch rejects negative strides while ferrotorch accepts CPU negative-stride as_strided; filed separately as #1970 so it is not silently bundled into this OOB-safety closure.","created_at":"2026-06-15T18:19:51.341818616Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAlpCKK+QMLaE7ccal5Te6wn+hSyLkNhhngrzAulcZ4qAO4G55zOpY0bLBoLxMzMu/Y949uzpiaIxCMCTkePj6Cw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMUIFuBwbmMlRu+PhnscEJ11wYGAQPVDAgCyqpORcBHDZPEqXq6CvP/WJi0MAr4O8B+56EcB4XkmRBJ+zt+LpQ8