{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":109,"timestamp":"2026-06-16T02:59:25.497375888Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"6b8b4927-6cc3-4cc3-a579-2d6ce00b3116","comment_uuid":"d50a4f8b-e10e-4b62-a14d-0051ecb2a11d","author":"y4rr","content":"Observation: PyTorch torch.nn.functional.linear accepts input rank >= 1 and applies the projection over the last dimension (1D -> [out_features], ND -> same leading dims + out_features). ferrotorch-nn::functional::linear currently rejects anything but 2D, while Linear/LazyLinear already flatten N-D inputs before calling core::grad_fns::linalg::linear_fused. This should be handled as an NN API parity issue, separate from CORE-050's core linalg validation fix.","created_at":"2026-06-16T02:59:25.495071777Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAEJQOchCR/rDknTL82WC1Zh2ayVcnC6zyiEYXyobIGoP5xDUa7LrDRNuoX98Uxrr24aOEYa5NAta7UgcqObT9Ag=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPAljk4SD4fpqervkZ/GN66pe2U10/7O+fpYOUi12h4uzA9I+QVMAC2t277KdLZ7yJxmWiZK6xfNwpkAAA1LjgE="}
