{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":111,"timestamp":"2026-06-16T03:00:03.632519643Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"9f5ac6f0-b023-43db-a29e-fb298ec3a584","comment_uuid":"d12fa5a7-486d-46a5-a7b8-158fb0e1337c","author":"y4rr","content":"Plan: mirror PyTorch's validation boundary before dispatch in core linalg autograd wrappers. Add shared validators for rank, same-device, mm/mm_bt/mv/dot/linear_fused shape contracts; call them before contiguous materialization, raw CPU loops, and CUDA backend dispatch. Add regression tests that assert structured Err and no panic for rank mismatches, inner-dim mismatches, truncated dot/mv cases, linear bias/weight mismatches, mixed-device operands, and CUDA invalid 2-D matmul paths.","created_at":"2026-06-16T03:00:03.630176220Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA8UQGDNIxxea7oSeIWn6TJWRJ217AdXNMSw8gzV8N9ec2sNK2CN4FOwn3fmRZUhnCAHPPWpxR+MSgkwGJtl7ICg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJIHgH1Wv5G9jT+JQZNUeQkXYJwaocj+19+y3VlXOIoKa8XINPqdzanQERVj/3tPXd4zpIA7BEDV6ovU6Pldgwo="}
