{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":208,"timestamp":"2026-06-16T06:43:57.103989158Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"8613c9e2-129e-424a-acd4-50a1ccf661d9","title":"Implement real torch.sparse.to_sparse_semi_structured CUDA packed layout","description":"Local PyTorch (/home/doll/pytorch/torch/sparse/semi_structured.py and aten/src/ATen/native/sparse/cuda/SparseSemiStructuredOps.cu) exposes torch.sparse.to_sparse_semi_structured as a 2-D contiguous CUDA tensor conversion with backend/dtype-specific row/column multiples and packed values/metadata. Ferrotorch currently has SemiStructuredSparseTensor::compress as a host Vec values+mask pruning/reference helper and sparse_matmul_24 uploads a decompressed dense masked matrix; it is not a true CUDA-resident SparseSemiStructuredTensor equivalent. Production PyTorch parity requires a real CUDA packed layout/API for f16/bf16 CUSPARSELT and f32 CUTLASS semantics, no host readback, plus tests against live PyTorch shape/dtype/device/contiguity behavior.","priority":"high","created_by":"y4rr"},"signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK79qZOp8cH5LmmrHigxYnv5X2UXtyy3BWChqgN5b5XPT88wJQbH8YZnlWwJGtr+m3Bs5pk1aUQooTDRQ2FeGw4="}
