{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":262,"timestamp":"2026-06-16T13:26:29.490149718Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"50384db4-6d3f-48c9-91c1-5a4129c7c472","comment_uuid":"a6e7eb71-23c1-4dfe-81cb-3fd0c34462a0","author":"y4rr","content":"Implemented PyTorch-aligned CUDA RNG fork semantics for ferrotorch-core: the default RNG current state remains shared and mutex-protected, while fork snapshots are thread-local so overlapping contexts cannot pop another thread's saved state. fork_rng now holds the state lock while recording the caller-local snapshot and installing the replacement seed; join_rng holds the same lock while popping/restoring. Added nested LIFO and deterministic overlapping-thread regression coverage; the overlapping test fails against the old process-global stack ordering.","created_at":"2026-06-16T13:26:29.422266373Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAc8wCKUMTE2t1E9js8WmKNXx5F8uGTEjLrETXr09I9pGlNE280+1jUKdK/g5ASnubCAcGXLQBgVbgueLhl0jsCQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCYgK7Ve/4bImbgxgqGJsvhERz3gZ71P1XjguqWf/55yLZjbrE0f3H/mp1odr9YkLMjX561NOr6O+jW0jE8dZA0="}
