{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":290,"timestamp":"2026-06-16T17:53:45.590249258Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"c97e868c-0a80-4005-b5ce-7b8b357c2475","comment_uuid":"8300c6aa-da52-47bf-972d-55c025e5cbe7","author":"y4rr","content":"Result: replaced gradient-enabled cond/scan CPU rewrapping with zero-copy stride-view wrappers that preserve the original output storage, strides, offset, and device. Backward now routes through the real branch/step output graph and returns explicit zeros for original inputs that the output does not reach. Verified with CPU and CUDA probes: cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --test audit_core116_117_higher_order_control_flow -- --nocapture; CUDARC_CUDA_VERSION=13000 cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --features gpu --test audit_core116_117_higher_order_control_flow -- --nocapture; cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --lib ops::higher_order; cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --lib; CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 cargo clippy -p ferrotorch-core --all-targets -- -D warnings; CUDARC_CUDA_VERSION=13000 CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 cargo clippy -p ferrotorch-core --all-targets --features gpu -- -D warnings.","created_at":"2026-06-16T17:53:45.550765775Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAGFsKdsfqsFgP9NqlhEsrl3TPcZHZ4NbHoKKFXZdeBcm83B8kL5l+Mcuf+nFkP4ZyES5Y6WLwiwGWGzu1665JAA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGyM+jJNUtOUhcOfDlgazWabydh3Mn1V0l5oxpqNgbtcXDmvszk5oJT1svx1Wt0tTSQJDxhRJhiMvsMVFqFd5Aw="}
