ty requires real CUDA-resident forwards/backwards, not CPU passthroughs. Fix by adding named CUDA paths/kernels for the affected activations and updating comments/tests so the feature-gated conformance runner is green.","priority":"high","created_by":"y4rr"},"signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQASNKB94RaiJze/MAa+MWHm3xPrN7uS0rvZk+3zbeIE+3UD3s+SbLNPKXFWbdpSsPW0xV6f72AT4x7GV98S6+Ao="}
